    "updated_at": "2016-06-14T04:58:44Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the comments. I'll fix things up and clarify the differences with `prefetch`.\nRegarding implementer interest, this is already implemented in Blink and I'm currently working on a WebKit implementation. (@sideshowbarker helpfully added a [meta-issue](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=158720) for the feature)\n\nFirefox have an [open bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1222633) marked as Priority 2 enhancement, and MS Edge [marked](https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/platform/status/preload?filter=f3f0000bf&search=preload) the feature as likely to be implemented in the future.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
